 data-rid="88d2cd26-3b71-4f53-91a8-46d7e50487c4" class="r-1q0xc53"><div data-rid="553d2d67-9ea0-4284-b7d4-c634784deb0f" class="r-150cbmz alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>In the rare case that this happens, we’ll send you a replacement flavour for free.</p><p>If your dog doesn’t like that one either, we’ll issue a full refund, no problem.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="76ee7eec-f594-464c-b9f3-483cce895999" class="r-57pe98" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="3fe144c1-8d26-43c6-8cc3-a62b0f889ac7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R2mr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-y87c1c"><div data-rid="7e39e909-1900-4220-b5d4-c2ed532fd698" class="r-su3v7e alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>At what age can my pup start using these? </p></span></div><div data-rid="7ff03a5f-be93-4af9-bb80-ca2b8c3ac949" class="r-1ni4rip"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R2mr2:"><div data-rid="49980559-c37f-488f-8e2d-2eacbb30e679" class="r-1mnyvtu"><div data-rid="2221c122-d62f-448d-9b9b-f81cb65d0661" class="r-32alms alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Multivitamin is suitable for dogs of all ages and breeds. However, we do recommend dogs begin to incorporate the chews into their daily routine starting at an age of 3 months or older.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="f83062f5-6f5c-4b06-9143-58a070efc288" class="r-u9d11n" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="1aecc024-4751-4519-a397-80658f577db1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3mr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1im5baz"><div data-rid="388fa402-5120-45a6-b0a7-f82334970478" class="r-1jyq6du alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What does 100% Human-Grade mean? </p></span></div><div data-rid="ba75a2d8-7193-4056-a714-60d40b45633f" class="r-i8wf5k"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R3mr2:"><div data-rid="1939ada6-fc1e-4997-a632-517e0064ba1b" class="r-1kz8ns4"><div data-rid="5549c86c-b88b-4028-806e-328b48685609" class="r-1287v3a alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Most pet supplements from other brands contain palm oil, fillers, artificial flavoring, preservatives, etc. At VitalPaws, we’re raising the standards of pet health by only using the highest quality human-grade ingredients, which is what our best friends deserve.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="0a61e8f1-5496-4d9f-b005-e64ca7914907" class="r-9s08yk" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="43a7af3a-e3c7-495a-9acc-6fa3321bf800" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R4mr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-10uex16"><div data-rid="399d75a5-80f6-4f6e-b3c0-e06229add6e2" class="r-1xrr60r alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How long until I start seeing the benefits?</p></span></div><div data-rid="dc0aecb7-ec7c-46b6-b46a-72a66d2afd39" class="r-rvs72y"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R4mr2:"><div data-rid="119f01e2-2146-4487-ab99-3811d7dd7b59" class="r-4m19jh"><div data-rid="c03761fd-0547-47bc-ae5b-0c73189770a9" class="r-1xrsju6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The benefits that most dogs feel—less itching, more activity, better mood—are just bonuses to improving their long-term health. If taken consistently on a daily basis, most dogs will start to see positive effects in about 6-8 weeks.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="92e605af-b80f-499d-9ee3-a5b0f15049f3" class="r-7m01ar" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="ea93dcb7-6633-4e41-8341-37056319e156" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5mr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-askjuh"><div data-rid="395c1f56-43e2-451a-95cf-3ac9736440ed" class="r-42ov8e alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How many chews come in a jar? </p></span></div><div data-rid="295dfb13-c446-4614-84f5-70ef4552c014" class="r-1siqg84"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R5mr2:"><div data-rid="f499f13a-05f1-4b57-b5b7-7b4591e2f6c3" class="r-r8e2cr"><div data-rid="4c8e0d11-82d5-4eb1-afa9-01881c342f4f" class="r-5tfeai alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>There are <strong>60 Chews in each jar</strong>, which is a monthly supply for all dogs.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="572cf788-b540-4cc1-9432-179aacb5af46" class="r-8wropu" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="13ad20f3-9b15-4228-b04c-318146841d17" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R6mr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1tuocdc"><div data-rid="09e5b2cc-ca4f-4c33-926b-c70cecb94d05" class="r-1bzrdrp alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What flavour is the Multivitamin?</p></span></div><div data-rid="d24bff1d-150f-4eb2-9787-19671090a413" class="r-o9s03v"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R6mr2:"><div data-rid="2f50d21f-e05b-4946-8fa4-c156fbaa0cef" class="r-1myiyjk"><div data-rid="faabb94b-563d-4b21-a647-e044971e8dbd" class="r-1ivz4nj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Our Multivitamin is made with the highest quality human-grade duck meat, a flavour that dogs absolutely love.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="067af3d6-b808-4788-98f4-238a2f5a0f40" class="r-1rz8ghl" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="d7bf4d7d-9ae0-4bb1-ad0e-151828f9b677" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7mr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-yxryaz"><div data-rid="01cc6fe4-4f4a-4a09-877c-adc2888f94b2" class="r-1c54pr2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What happens if I accidentally give my dog too many chews? </p></span></div><div data-rid="d903a42b-d48b-4379-9f02-8ce29b5ccded" class="r-1nps647"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R7mr2:"><div data-rid="efbc7b82-710c-4b12-9f1a-b22271673820" class="r-1uq1gh"><div data-rid="e32c747b-5a64-42dd-a543-d603a96cd197" class="r-1wa4i8q alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>In the event that your dog accidentally consumes significantly more than the daily recommended dose, consult your vet for advice.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="9ba5ea31-4e3c-4c44-a91a-4b3a68eadf99" class="r-1685ndt" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="f1311262-cc27-40ef-bd5f-bb105dac9f8d" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R8mr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1qm0ko7"><div data-rid="f3c4294f-cc98-47e8-959d-3d0d62996d4f" class="r-omuo09 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I take this dog multivitamin with other supplements? </p></span></div><div data-rid="cf8fdb85-883b-4d94-99d0-b1468ef42ba4" class="r-p2umrc"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R8mr2:"><div data-rid="819972a4-59bd-4db0-bf3d-9bd36d56544b" class="r-1xjsot9"><div data-rid="ededb848-ceca-4270-9c2a-70b04cc2eab4" class="r-s0ep6a alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Our veterinary team formulated our Daily Vitamin with natural ingredients that can be taken both alone or as a complementary product with other common and more targeted pet supplements. Nevertheless, we still recommend checking with your vet.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><style>@import url(https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900;950)</style></div>
